WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.895
This slide asks you to diagnose a poorly designed
everything table Start

00:00:05.921 --> 00:00:10.648
with identity There is no stable primary key and
names are not

00:00:10.661 --> 00:00:17.049
reliable identifiers Next look at row grain Patient

00:00:17.181 --> 00:00:23.287
provider appointment services and charges are all
mixed together Then

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:28.592
inspect types Time and money are stored as text
making validation and

00:00:28.619 --> 00:00:34.208
calculation harder The services column also contains
a list instead

00:00:34.221 --> 00:00:39.730
of one relational value Before revealing the repair
direction try

00:00:39.756 --> 00:00:44.772
to name at least three problems yourself The goal is
not merely

00:00:44.798 --> 00:00:49.906
to split the table because normalization says so
Explain which fact belongs

00:00:49.919 --> 00:00:53.932
to which entity which identifiers need protection
and which rules should become

00:00:53.945 --> 00:00:55.156
database constraints
